# Keep build artifacts and VCS metadata out of docker build contexts. This dir
# is the git root and is also consumed as the `gpgnet4ta` named build context by
# the private replayserver repo's Dockerfile — without this, the multi-GB
# in-source build/ tree gets transferred and the build stalls/cancels.
.git/
build/
build-*/
bin/
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.exe
